1
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:05,100
Friend 1: Honestly? I’m exhausted.

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,550
Work, bills, family…

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,450
I can’t remember the last time I felt okay.

4
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:12,500
Friend 2: Same. Everyone says, go see a therapist.

5
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,050
When? I barely have time to sleep.

6
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:17,750
Friend 1: I wouldn’t even know where to start.

7
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:20,900
Friend 2: I just wish there was something on my phone.

8
00:00:20,950 --> 00:00:22,850
Something that checks in on me,

9
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:24,900
and helps me find the right therapist

10
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:25,750
when I’m ready.

11
00:00:25,990 --> 00:00:28,550
Friend 1: And I bet we’re not the only ones.

12
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:30,100
They’re not.

13
00:00:32,260 --> 00:00:33,900
A mental health app can meet people

14
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:35,150
right where they are.

15
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:37,100
Daily mood check-ins,

16
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,450
and a journal that shows how they really feel.

17
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:42,250
Guided breathing and calming AI audio

18
00:00:42,250 --> 00:00:43,700
for the hard nights.

19
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:45,300
And when they’re ready,

20
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:47,750
a real therapist, just a few taps away.

21
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:49,500
Plus a caring community,

22
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:51,750
so no one has to struggle alone.

23
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:54,350
Have an idea for a mental health app?

24
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:55,980
Reach out to us.

25
00:00:56,050 --> 00:00:57,250
Let’s create it together,

26
00:00:57,250 --> 00:00:59,500
and make this world a better place for everyone.
